{
    desc => q{o opens a new line below and enters insert mode},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/insert_open_o`

Tests that the **o** command opens a new blank line below the current line
and enters insert mode with the cursor on the new line.

**Keys:** `o`, type `inserted line`, `Escape`

**initial.png**
- Buffer has 2 lines: "line one" and "line two"
- Cursor on line 1 at column 0

**after_open_below.png**
- Buffer has 3 lines: "line one", "inserted line", "line two"
- Cursor on line 2 (the new line)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->key('o');
        $ctx->type('inserted line');
        $ctx->key('Escape');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_open_below');
    },
}
__DATA__
line one
line two
